o spacecraft and a satellite in a step towards low-cost orbital infrastructure.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://spacenews.com/qingzhou-prototype-cargo-spacecraft-completes-rendezvous-tests-in-orbit/\">Qingzhou prototype cargo spacecraft completes rendezvous tests in orbit </a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://spacenews.com\">SpaceNews</a>.</p>\n",
